OL,3,GNEWSA'Poundland closure would leave a
OL,4,Avoid in our town'
OL,5,
OL,6,FLosing Poundland would leave a "big
OL,7,Fvoid" in the town where it was founded,
OL,8,Fshoppers have said.
OL,10,FIt was announced on Thursday that
OL,11,Fbosses of the retail chain had filed a
OL,12,Fnotice of intention to appoint
OL,13,Fadministrators, giving the business 10
OL,14,Fdays to find a rescue deal.
OL,16,FThe uncertainty surrounding Poundland's
OL,17,Ffuture has left some of its 12,000
OL,18,Fmembers of staff fearful about the
OL,19,Ffuture of their jobs.
OL,23,APub: 31-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,353,350,200,160,0,100
