OL,3,GNEWSA'Poundland closure would leave a
OL,4,Avoid in our town'
OL,5,
OL,6,F"It's sad because you could go in and
OL,7,Fhave a bargain, there's always
OL,8,Fsomething you can pick up. It's part of
OL,9,Fthe community, there will be a big void
OL,10,Funless someone can turn it around,"
OL,11,Fsaid local resident Pete Harper.
